  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Conservacin y Manejo Recuperaciones Forestales</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forestry Resources Management Conservation Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM CONTEMPLATES THE EXECUTION OF RECOMMENDED ACTIONS INCLUDED IN THE FOREST ACTION PLAN RELATED TO THE ATLANTIC COAST AS WELL AS THE CENTRAL ZONE.IT CONSISTS OF 3 COMPONENTS:1)ESTABLISHMENT OF AGROFOREST SYSTEMS IN BASINS IN PROCESS OF DEGRADATION AND DEVELOPMENT 0F 15 INDIGENOUS COMUNITIES AND PROJECSTS; 2)MANAGEMENT AND CONSERVATION OF PROTECTED AREAS AND 3)INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
